## Mandatory Workflow

**Before any commit, you MUST pass the Final Gate:**
```bash
python scripts/final_gate.py
```

## Planning Rules

All plans in `docs/development/plans/` MUST include the **One-Test Rule**:
- **Why:** High-leverage risk coverage (e.g., Job State Management, Tenant Isolation)
- **Contract:** Given/When/Then with explicit mocked vs. real components
- **Example:** Job claiming logic - verify status updates even on processing failure

## Build & Test

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
pytest
ruff check .
```

## Run Locally

```bash
python -m worker.main
